Package: coremp135-hdmi-blob
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: coremp135 build <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6
Section: non-free/misc
Priority: optional
Description: LT8618SXB HDMI bridge setup for the M5Stack CoreMP135 (binary)
 Runs M5Stack's prebuilt, closed-source lt8618sxb_mcu_config tool at boot,
 which programs the Lontium LT8618SXB HDMI transmitter over I2C.
 Fetched unmodified at build time from
 github.com/m5stack/CoreMP135_buildroot-external-st (pinned + checksummed).
 Temporary: to be replaced by a Linux DRM bridge driver (see docs/TODO.md).
